  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Education Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The USAID Environmental Education Program is implemented for the purpose of: (1) identifying the environment, biodiversity and climate-related problems in three ecological subregions in the Vietnamese Mekong Delta (VMD); (2) developing documents, organizing training sessions and seminars to improve the knowledge and skills for young people in all 13 provinces in the Mekong Delta in order to contribute to solving issues related to climate change, environment and biodiversity.</narrative>
  </description>
